cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "sdt-netval: topological validation of LLM-driven Social Digital Twins"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabrifurna/sdt-netval"
authors:
  - alias: "fabrifurna"
abstract: >-
  Python library that validates the macroscopic network topology of LLM-based
  agent-based social simulations (power-law exponent, modularity, clustering) and
  quantifies how recommender systems perturb it, through baseline-vs-condition
  non-parametric tests.
keywords:
  - social network analysis
  - agent-based modelling
  - digital twins
  - LLM simulation
